<view class="page"><view class="title">登录猫出没</view><view class="notice">真实微信登录尚未接入，当前不会伪造登录成功。</view><button class="primary" data-mode="wechat" bindtap="login" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">微信登录</button><view wx:if="{{development}}"><view class="notice">仅限本地开发：服务端显式启用后，输入本机 .env 的开发密钥。此方式不代表微信认证。</view><input password value="{{key}}" bindinput="keyInput" placeholder="本地开发密钥"/><button data-mode="dev" bindtap="login" disabled="{{busy}}">开发身份登录</button></view><view class="notice">{{message}}</view><button bindtap="back">返回</button></view>
